# Tasks

Purpose: the work queue on the canvas — tasks where you already look,
instead of a separate tab. Exists because dashboards that only inform
get ignored; one that holds your todo gets opened every morning.

Size/position: drag + resize on the canvas (dnd), never in the menu.
Relevancy: 🔥 core · ⭐ valuable · 💤 later

| Option | Category | Relevancy | Values / default | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| title | display | 🔥 | text | |
| showToolbar | display | 🔥 | on / off | runtime assignee switcher |
| showComposer | display | 🔥 | on / off | inline "+ add task" |
| showDone | display | 🔥 | on / off | done group collapsed |
| assignee | filter | 🔥 | all / me / none | default scope |
| variant | layout | ⭐ | full surface / checklist | checklist = no chrome |
| group by | display | ⭐ | status (default) / priority / none | |
| row meta | display | ⭐ | due / priority / labels / assignee toggles | |
| status | filter | ⭐ | status[] (proposed) | |
| due | filter | ⭐ | any / overdue / this week (proposed) | |
| concept | filter | ⭐ | any / conceptId (proposed) | tasks on instances of that concept (task -> instance -> conceptId) |
| icon | display | 💤 | icon name / none | |
| limit | display | 💤 | none / n | checklist variant |
| label | filter | 💤 | label[] (proposed) | |
| instance conditions | filter | 💤 | SidebarCondition[] on parent instance (proposed) | e.g. tasks on open deals only |
